    pattern: '<b>Vertical breakout out of a 5-month triangle — box (2.05–2.25), second leg to 2.71, spike to 3.24 (Oct 23), reversal to 2.44 (Oct 26), reclaim to 3.21 (Oct 28 — double top with 3.24), breakout line lost a second time Nov 2 (2.335), box top lost Nov 5 (2.15), held (Nov 6, 2.23) and reclaimed Nov 9 (2.38), EMA20 ties Nov 9–12, lost Nov 13 (2.32), box top and the retest low lost Nov 16 (2.10, −9.5%, unsized), both reclaimed Nov 17 (2.36, +12.4%, 47% of average volume), EMA20 cleared and 2.42 / 2.44 reached by a tie Nov 18 (2.43, +3.0%, 56%) — the highest close since Oct 30.</b> Ceiling 3.95 (Mar 24) → 1.12 (Sep 9), 4 touches, broken Sep 29 (1.365). Floor 0.852 → 0.891 held (~0.98 today). The triangle projection (~3.4) was never reached; 3.21–3.24 is the top. Above the close: 2.44 (Oct 26 shakeout low — tied), 2.60 (Oct 22 close — the first ceiling with margin), 2.71 (the breakout line — lost twice, the +1M), 2.72 (engine +1M), 2.73 (Oct 30 close), 2.89 (the invalidation), 2.95, 3.21–3.24. Below: 2.42 (Nov 11 close — tied, the first target), 2.38 (Nov 9 / 12 closes), 2.36 (Nov 17 close — the reclaim bar), 2.352 (EMA20 — cleared), 2.32, 2.25 (box top — lost twice, reclaimed twice; the first step down), 2.23, 2.15 (the Nov 5 retest low — the old stop), 2.10 (the Nov 16 shakeout low — the stop), 2.09 (EMA50), 2.05 (box floor), 1.93 / 1.90 (EMA100 / EMA200), 1.70 (engine invalidation).',
